WEBVTT

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.520
We're back—

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.300
Yay! We're home!

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.700
I'm home!

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.990
Ibuki-oneechan...

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.900
It doesn't matter when

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.330
I always think of your smile

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:41.800
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:47.000
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:50.480
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:53.220
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:57.970
In front of you, I swear that

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.830
I will always be your side

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:07.710
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:11.270
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:16.940
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:21.800
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:31.730
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:31.730
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:37.180
In the same world

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:52.550
Eleventh Longsword

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.550
Ibuki-san is Mine

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:55.320
I'm home!

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.020
Daddy!

00:01:58.380 --> 00:01:59.930
Mommy!

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:07.130
Why isn't anyone here?

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:08.890
I've told you a million times.

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:12.070
Dad and Mom are both out training.

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:14.250
It's just us sisters here.

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:17.900
Plus the samurai...

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:20.410
Samurai?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.000
You came here to destroy our dojo?!

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:27.870
Huh?

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.830
Unforgivable!

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:38.160
Ikaruga Ibuki, four years old.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:42.850
I might look young, but I'm skilled in the Ukiha Divine Wind Style.

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:46.520
She says she's four... That's cheating...

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.740
This is hopeless.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.810
She's been like this since we were at the hot springs.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:52.620
Daddy! Mommy!

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:55.360
Someone's here to destroy our dojo!

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.860
Daddy! Mommy!

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.310
Where are you?!

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.620
Did she lose her memories?

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:07.350
It seems like she's reverted back to her four-year-old self.

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:08.240
Daddy! Mommy! Where are you?!

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:10.370
I think it's because of that strange drug those siblings gave her.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.040
Those two...

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.210
disappeared without a trace.

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:21.630
Should we take her to a doctor?

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:32.020
Ayame! Chihaya!

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.520
We're right here!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.150
Lies...

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:39.090
Ayame and Chihaya are my little sisters.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:41.470
Look, I'm Ayame.

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:46.550
You're taller and have bigger breasts.

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:49.910
Ayame's breasts are way smaller than yours.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.870
That was a long time ago.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:55.880
Pay attention now.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.130
Ayame.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:58.380
Chihaya.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:03:59.670
Kagome.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.140
We're your family.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.170
We're your little sisters.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.850
Um... I think you forgot about me...

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.780
No way!

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:11.680
Ayame and Chihaya should be smaller, plus I only have two sisters!

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.940
I don't know anyone named Kagome.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.430
Onee-chan, you're lying, right?

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:26.910
You still remember me, don't you?

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:31.380
Who...

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:32.910
are you?

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:35.770
Kagome!

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:36.530
Kagome-dono!

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.800
You just crossed the line!

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:42.340
Cut it out!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.640
Ayame-nee!

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:48.080
Kagome wasn't born yet when she was four, so...

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.600
I'm scared...

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.020
I hate scary people!

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.900
I hate them!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.140
Ibuki-dono.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.740
Dojo-destroyer guy...

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:26.630
Those three are definitely your younger sisters.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:29.430
Lies! They're all bigger than me.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:34.690
You're much older than you think you are.

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:35.990
Which is why...

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:40.690
Ayame-dono, Chihaya-dono, and Kagome-dono all relied on you.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:46.200
Even if you tell me that, I don't know anyone named Kagome.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:53.490
You might have forgotten it now, but we'll all help you retrieve your memories.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.010
Anyway, let's go back.

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.270
Sis—

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.660
Y-You're hungry, aren't you?

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:33.660
Huh? Ibuki-san turned into a little girl?

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:38.950
Yes, that's what Karasuma said, but I'm not sure of the details.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:41.220
Then, I'll go check it out.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:42.730
See ya!

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.090
Be careful.

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:57.420
I knew it would be difficult, but we're still far from reviving our dojo.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:06:59.230
Welco—

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:02.560
Hot!

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.250
What are you doing?

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.970
But it's hot...

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:09.910
You're a complete child.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:23.790
Sis, don't run around naked!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:26.050
It's lively here, but not in the usual sense.

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:29.670
Will she get better?

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.590
She's finally asleep.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.730
Thanks for the hard work.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.860
I'm sorry.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:45.230
I can't help you with giving her a bath or putting her to sleep.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.710
Don't you think I know that?

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:50.920
Was she that immature when she was four?

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:53.280
It's hard to believe, being used to how she is normally.

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:55.660
Ayame-dono,

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:58.820
I have something to ask you.

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:02.290
Fiancé?!

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:05.330
That Ukyou guy is my sister's...?

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:07.370
That's what he said.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.310
Is it true?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.440
Sis and Dad never mentioned it.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:17.350
It didn't seem like a lie from his tone.

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:23.850
If he's really Ibuki-dono's fiancé, why did he drug her?

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:30.220
In any case, we have to catch those siblings to get Ibuki-dono back to normal.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:36.080
I'm going to go ask Hinagata-dono about this tomorrow.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.830
Do you think she'll go to school after all this?

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.830
If she doesn't go, I'll go look for her.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.800
You're so unreliable.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:46.970
I'm sorry.

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:53.050
Hey, Samurai.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.340
If that guy really is my sister's fiancé, what will you do?

00:08:58.340 --> 00:08:59.060
Huh?

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:03.060
My sister might end up marrying him.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.460
What would you do then?

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:07.560
What would I do...?

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.280
If that happens...

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:27.940
Ayame-dono?

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:28.940
I'm going to bed.

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:42.540
Masashi-kun!

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:47.070
You took a direct hit from Ibuki-sensei's wooden sword.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:49.980
Yay! I win! I win!

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:53.060
Ibuki-sensei is a little weird today.

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:55.610
She's more childish than usual...

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:58.610
I win! I win! I win! I win!

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.440
But this is...

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:03.120
Masashi-kun's not breathing!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:05.480
I'm sorry! I'm really sorry!

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.370
I'm sorry!

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:11.880
It's fine, but Ibuki-sensei is acting really strange today.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.220
Is she sick or something?

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:19.130
As I thought, we shouldn't have let her teach.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.690
This isn't funny, you dumb sister!

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:24.280
That's going too far!

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:26.020
What's going on?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:31.100
She was throwing scissors around and nearly hit Chihaya!

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.650
It wasn't on purpose! They just slipped!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.050
I don't care!

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.600
You're taking your pranks too far!

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:41.530
Ayame-nee, I'm fine! I was just a little surprised!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:46.160
Ibuki-dono, you should be careful with sharp objects.

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:48.600
Anyway, please apologize to Chihaya-dono.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.130
No.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:52.920
Ibuki-dono...

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.630
I said no!

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:58.450
Who are you all?

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:02.320
This is my house, but I always get scolded...

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.120
Get out!

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.180
Excuse me.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.460
I apologize for the sudden visit.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:25.840
You see, I came here to ask about Ibuki-san—

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:29.000
What the hell did you do to Ibuki-dono?!

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:34.500
I just gave her what she wished for.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.780
I apologize for what happened the other day.

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:39.140
You really think an apology is gonna cut it?!

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:40.510
I'll take you to the police!

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:44.120
It was my drug that turned Ibuki-san into what she is now.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:49.520
If you report my brother to the police, I'll never give you the antidote.

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:51.180
What did you say?!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.040
Please calm down.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:57.480
It's true that Sakon made Ibuki-san act like a child,

00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:59.940
but she's not the only one to blame.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.490
What do you mean?

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:07.320
Sakon's medicine allowed Ibuki-san to revert back to a stage...

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:11.220
that she desired most and felt most happy about.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:16.960
In other words, her current condition is what her heart truly desires.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.000
Being four?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.400
Quit making stuff up!

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.420
It's impossible!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.470
If what you say is true, then she's happier than—

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.930
That's our point.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:32.950
Ibuki-san has to worry about the dojo and her family every day.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:35.900
Perhaps she's tired of all that responsibility.

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:41.440
Practice should be over already, Wassan.

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:46.050
I'm late because you lost your wallet.

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:48.660
At least let me have a glimpse of Ikaruga-san—

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:50.820
Ikaruga-san?!

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:52.200
What are you doing here?

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:57.170
Let's get you back inside.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.780
No!

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:01.710
I don't want to go home!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.720
Take me somewhere else, mister...

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:05.720
Okay!

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:07.720
For real?

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.730
I'm sorry for spying on you guys,

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:15.190
but you couldn't even take care of her for one day.

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.100
That's...

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:23.110
Having Ibuki-san live like that in this house won't be good for you guys or her.

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:27.110
As her fiancé, I would like to take her away.

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:28.780
That's right!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:32.910
The problem here is I've never heard about my sister having a fiancé.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:39.710
The engagement was made between the two of us.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:40.860
Anyway,

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:43.520
the antidote will take a couple months to complete.

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:47.530
During that time, I'll take full responsibility for all of you.

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:48.720
Responsibility?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:54.730
We will let you experience the life of a celebrity.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.280
Celebrity?!

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:58.480
Real butlers and real maids!

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:00.980
Well then, Karasuma Yoichi.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.650
I have something else to talk to you about.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.790
I'm back!

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:08.450
Oh, welcome back.

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:11.590
Where did Angie go?

00:14:11.590 --> 00:14:16.250
She left with some weird guys and maids during lunch.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:17.690
Huh?

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:20.740
She said she was going to the Ikaruga dojo.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.500
Yay!

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.280
We made a huge castle!

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:26.570
This is great!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.010
Y-Yeah...

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:32.010
Hey, Wassan, isn't Ikaruga-san a bit strange today?

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:36.120
It's like she's being childish, or she's actually a child...

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:40.560
You have no right to say that, but you've got a point...

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:44.270
Mister, thanks for buying me these clothes.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.190
My old ones were really loose, so they felt weird...

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.630
Well, you're welcome.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:51.760
It's weird! It really is!

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.620
I'm going to the dojo to find out what happened.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:54.370
Torigaya—

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.690
Don't go!

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.370
Don't leave me alone...

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.360
Okay!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.210
I don't care if it's strange.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.260
As long as I'm with Ikaruga-san...

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:06.380
Time, just freeze it right here!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.260
So this is a celebrity's lifestyle...

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:17.830
This will be your life from now on.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:23.020
If my brother and Ibuki-san can be together, the dojo will receive help from the Saginomiya family,

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:26.020
and everyone will be happy.

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:28.560
There's no need to hesitate.

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:31.820
What do you want to tell me?

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:38.830
Although I don't know how you tricked Ibuki-san into forgetting our engagement...

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.550
You're mistaken! I never—

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:42.500
That's enough.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.480
Ibuki-san has forgotten everything.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:48.950
Her heart is as pure as water.

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:52.100
Just as it was when I first met her.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:53.760
Karasuma Yoichi,

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.850
what have you been doing here so far?

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:03.600
Haven't you just been bothering the Ikaruga family, using training as an excuse to stay with them?

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:09.030
Yesterday, all you did was cause trouble.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.740
You weren't of any help at all.

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:17.530
I pity Ibuki-san and her sisters for having to take care of someone like you.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:21.040
That is why I will save them.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:29.790
While I shouldn't even worry about you, I've prepared a place for you as well.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:34.510
Angela-dono?

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:39.130
Karasuma, do you want to join the Tsubame Flowing Style?

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:40.280
What?!

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:43.560
You don't have to stay here for training.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:49.110
Build a dojo and train with them.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:51.530
I shall fund it.

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:55.510
I still remember what you told me.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:58.560
However, the situation now is different.

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:03.660
We won't be doing dishonest things anymore, and this will make everyone happy.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.200
Tsubasa-sama would also want that person to...

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:07.270
That person?

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:09.970
Do you understand?

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:13.120
I have both money and power.

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:17.090
I can make everyone happy, unlike you.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:20.100
Isn't that person...

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:23.280
Karasuma Yoichi, I'll tell you what you should do.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:25.610
Leave everything to me.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.100
That is the best choice.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:30.740
Karasuma.

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.610
Just leave Ibuki-san to me,

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:38.150
and please enjoy yourselves.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.970
Is this for real?

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:58.970
Understood, Sakon-sama.

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:05.480
Ibuki-sama, it's time.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:07.030
Who are you?

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:09.190
Ukyou-sama and Sakon-sama are waiting for you.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.730
Please come with me.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:10.730
What?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.050
What the hell are you doing?!

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:20.660
You bastard...

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.620
Save me, mister!

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:28.240
No!

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:34.100
I'm sorry for making you wait, Ibuki-san.

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.090
Save...

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:44.410
Drive.

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:47.930
What the heck is this?!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:51.060
For some reason, this stopped tasting good.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.940
This isn't really what I wanted to draw...

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.180
Something is missing.

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:57.940
Ayame-dono, Chihaya-dono.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:01.430
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:05.620
I'm going to join the Tsubame Flowing Style.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:08.070
Huh? Why so sudden?

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:10.120
What about Ibuki-nee?

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.890
I've left her with Ukyou-dono.

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:16.630
I couldn't do anything, after all.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.880
Don't jump to conclusions!

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.240
Wait, what's going on?

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:24.890
Ikaruga-san seems to be in some trouble...

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.680
Kei-chan, did you see Ibuki-nee?

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:30.430
She was playing at the park with Wassan.

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:32.940
There's no need to worry if she was with Washizu-dono.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.900
It's unfortunate that I can't give her a proper farewell.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:41.810
Sorry for making you worry about my sister until the end.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:43.370
I get it.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.950
Get out of here, and thanks for everything.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.200
Sure, decide everything on your own?

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.390
It's enough.

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.640
We're going to live a rich life from now on, after all.

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:52.050
Right, Chihaya?

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:54.460
Right, Kagome?

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:56.800
Kagome?

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:01.920
What are you doing?

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.100
Come downstairs.

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:05.260
There's a lot of food and clothes.

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:06.350
The doll...

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:09.090
There are plenty of dolls.

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:11.100
Take whatever you want, especially since they're top quality.

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:13.560
I don't want them.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.980
I just want this...

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:18.430
It's yesterday's...

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:20.150
It's broken already, isn't it?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.620
Then yesterday...

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:28.120
She just wanted to fix the doll...

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:32.660
Will Ibuki-oneechan ever come back?

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:37.170
Has she really forgotten about me?

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.130
That's impossible!

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:48.620
Angela-dono, give me one more day.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:49.640
Karasuma...

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:52.470
I nearly ran away.

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:59.440
I haven't done a thing for Ibuki-dono, Ayame-dono, Chihaya-dono, or Kagome-dono's sake.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.450
I haven't done the only thing I can do for them.

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:10.700
I'm still in training here, which is why I won't be able to move on until I accomplish something here.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.430
Yoichi-oniichan...

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.940
Don't worry.

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:18.420
I'll turn Ibuki-dono back to her normal self.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.460
Really?

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.370
A warrior never goes back on his words.

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:24.220
Do you even have a plan?

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:28.220
I figured you didn't.

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:30.220
We'll go with you!

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:39.930
Sorry...

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:41.940
It's all right, just wait a little longer.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:43.150
I'll take you to the hospital.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:46.430
No, I just need some water splashed on my face.

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:48.570
There's no time to go to the hospital...

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.440
But...

00:21:51.300 --> 00:21:53.540
Onii-sama, you're such a liar.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:57.540
Wasn't turning her back into a four-year-old your idea?

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:00.330
It doesn't matter.

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:04.590
I like you just the way you are now.

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:08.930
Just like when we first met...

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:27.240
I regret not realizing

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:34.810
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:42.370
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:51.830
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:56.060
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:55.860 --> 00:22:59.820
Make me hesitate a little

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:06.810
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:10.680
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:14.530
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:14.570 --> 00:23:16.880
You're not alone

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:21.210
Because I love you

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:25.820
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:29.380
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:36.840
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:41.980
Next Time!

00:23:41.980 --> 00:24:07.000
Twelfth Longsword

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:47.870
Yo-Yoichi...

00:23:47.870 --> 00:23:51.530
you have to press B here and sprint...

00:23:54.470 --> 00:23:55.230
Yoichi...

00:23:55.230 --> 00:23:56.990
N-No, no!

00:23:57.910 --> 00:24:00.580
Don't eat fried noodles at lunch...

00:24:01.520 --> 00:24:02.670
Yoichi.

00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:05.620
It's the last episode...

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:10.010
Don't miss the next episode!

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:09.260
When am I getting the spotlight?
